  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for Modgud resource servers. Reads\n      Modgud's resource_access[audience] claim from the JWT/UserInfo\n      and surfaces roles/permissions/groups as flat claims so\n      [Authorize(Roles=\"...\")] and .RequiresCocoarPermission(\"...\") work\n      natively. Bypass tiers are pre-expanded by the IdP, so the lib does\n      pure exact-match — no evaluator logic, no HTTP client, no caching.",
